# Portfolio OS v1.0

Official reference: `portfolio-os/Portfolio_OS_v1.0.md` (v1.0.5)  
Workflow: `portfolio-os/PLAYBOOK.md`  
Memory: `portfolio-os/memory-index.md`  
Writing: `portfolio-os/WRITING_STANDARD.md` (required for all text)  
Release: `portfolio-os/release/RELEASE_GATE.md` — levels L0–L3; no artefact complete without READY TO SHIP  
Knowledge: Paper = temporary · Obsidian = permanent (`portfolio-os/knowledge/KNOWLEDGE_PIPELINE.md`)

## Default

1. Start with **portfolio-producer** unless a skill is named.
2. Producer reads **memory-index** first and emits `For this task, read only: …`
3. Prefer ⭐ Gold prompts from `prompts/INDEX.md` (never Experimental in production).
4. One deliverable per thread; fewest skills; no full-repo context dumps.
5. Log important decisions/assumptions/experiments under `portfolio-os/governance/`.
6. Do not expand the OS without Decision Log + version bump. **Build the portfolio next.**

## Priorities

**P0:** portfolio-producer · portfolio-architect · story-strategist · creative-director  
**P1:** design-intelligence-lab · visual-director · motion-director · interaction-designer · systems-designer · editorial-director  
**P2:** framer-builder  
